##### GLOBAL_VOCAB_MARKER
# This file explicitly does not have a `.talon-list` extension, because we don't want talon to read it.
# Instead this is included into both and `dictation-list.tolan-list` and `vocabulary.talon-list`.
# as talon doesn't have a "#include" mechanism, the contents of this file is
# added into both of these files by custom code.
#
# The custom code is triggered by the phrase "update talon list"
#
# The content here replaces the "global vocabulary section" in the target files if already present.
# Otherwise, the content is appended to the existing content of the target files.
# The content is wrapped in comment markers in the target files so that we know what section needs to be replaced.

